  "title": "Arthur Johnston (priest)",
  "text": "Arthur Joseph Johnston (1866–1941) was an Irish Anglican\n\nJohnston was educated at Trinity College, Dublin and ordained in 1891. His first post was as a curate at Drumcannon. He held incumbencies in Forkhill, Drumbanagher, Kilcullen and Athy; and was Archdeacon of Glendalough from 1914 until 1941.",
